    "text": "By Jeff Jenkins ,\n9 hours ago CHARLESTON, W.Va. — More than 1,200 volunteers battled the heat Wednesday to get much-needed projects done during the 21st annual United Way of Central West Virginia Day of Caring. The volunteers could be found at dozens of sites in Kanawha, Putnam, Boone, Logan, Clay and Braxton counties doing things... Read full article\n1",
